{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/MeetTheQuota.png?t=1750283559\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/Steam_horror_backrooms_Gif_1.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a contract runner for <strong>Backrooms Union</strong>. Pick a level\u2014Level 0\u2019s endless yellow walls, the damp Boiler Tunnels, the humming Poolrooms, and more\u2014then head inside to <strong>collect scrap</strong> for the Union\u2019s bottom line. Haul enough before shift\u2019s end or management \u201crestructures\u201d you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/DontBeCornered.png?t=1750283559\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/Steam_horror_backrooms_Gif_2.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level crawls with <strong>Backrooms entities</strong> that stalk noise, light, or the scent of fear. Go in solo for the full panic, or bring a squad and cover each other with call-outs and walkie talkies. Staying together is your best insurance policy\u2014sometimes your only one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/CashWellSpent.png?t=1750283559\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/Steam_horror_backrooms_Gif_3gif.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn today\u2019s hazard pay into tomorrow\u2019s edge: tougher suits, brighter lamps, faster feet\u2014whatever helps you dive deeper and drag more junk out alive. Better gear means bigger quotas, but the Union never stops raising the bar.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/CollectOrDie.png?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/CompanyGif.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose a level.</i><br><i>Find the scrap.</i><br><i>Hit the quota.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Miss it, and the Backrooms keep the difference.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816820?t=1750283559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816820?t=1750283559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/5c85d35592ffe445ec387cc031263511336f80a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750283559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/5c85d35592ffe445ec387cc031263511336f80a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750283559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/MeetTheQuota.png?t=1750283559\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/Steam_horror_backrooms_Gif_1.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a contract runner for <strong>Backrooms Union</strong>. Pick a level\u2014Level 0\u2019s endless yellow walls, the damp Boiler Tunnels, the humming Poolrooms, and more\u2014then head inside to <strong>collect scrap</strong> for the Union\u2019s bottom line. Haul enough before shift\u2019s end or management \u201crestructures\u201d you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/DontBeCornered.png?t=1750283559\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/Steam_horror_backrooms_Gif_2.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level crawls with <strong>Backrooms entities</strong> that stalk noise, light, or the scent of fear. Go in solo for the full panic, or bring a squad and cover each other with call-outs and walkie talkies. Staying together is your best insurance policy\u2014sometimes your only one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/CashWellSpent.png?t=1750283559\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/Steam_horror_backrooms_Gif_3gif.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn today\u2019s hazard pay into tomorrow\u2019s edge: tougher suits, brighter lamps, faster feet\u2014whatever helps you dive deeper and drag more junk out alive. Better gear means bigger quotas, but the Union never stops raising the bar.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/CollectOrDie.png?t=1750283559\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/CompanyGif.gif?t=1750283559\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose a level.</i><br><i>Find the scrap.</i><br><i>Hit the quota.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Miss it, and the Backrooms keep the difference.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sushi Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/da93aca8a33d7a50ed04a417d0df7b87a44b3c77/header.jpg?t=1750283559","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157176,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157176/movie480.mp4?t=1750283556","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157176/movie_max.mp4?t=1750283556"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbn